{
  "id": "keep-api-internal",
  "title": {
    "tr": "API içeride kalsın",
    "en": "Keep the API inside"
  },
  "difficulty": 2,
  "language": "docker",
  "prompt": {
    "tr": "prompt.tr.md",
    "en": "prompt.en.md"
  },
  "entry": "compose.yaml",
  "files": [
    {
      "name": "compose.yaml",
      "starter": "starter-compose.yaml",
      "solution": "solution-compose.yaml"
    },
    {
      "name": "api/Dockerfile",
      "readonly": true
    },
    {
      "name": "api/server.py",
      "readonly": true
    },
    {
      "name": "site/index.html",
      "readonly": true
    }
  ],
  "timeout_sec": 180,
  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "`api` altındaki `ports:` ve altındaki satırı sil.",
      "en": "Delete `ports:` and the line below it under `api`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n**compose.yaml**\n\n```yaml\nservices:\n  web:\n    image: python:3.13-slim\n    working_dir: /srv\n    volumes:\n      - ./site:/srv\n    command: [\"python\", \"-m\", \"http.server\", \"8000\"]\n    ports:\n      - \"8093:8000\"\n  api:\n    build: ./api\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n**compose.yaml**\n\n```yaml\nservices:\n  web:\n    image: python:3.13-slim\n    working_dir: /srv\n    volumes:\n      - ./site:/srv\n    command: [\"python\", \"-m\", \"http.server\", \"8000\"]\n    ports:\n      - \"8093:8000\"\n  api:\n    build: ./api\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "compose",
      "service": "api",
      "no_ports": true
    },
    {
      "type": "compose",
      "service": "web",
      "ports": [
        "8093:8000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "compose_up",
      "running": [
        "web",
        "api"
      ],
      "http": [
        {
          "service": "web",
          "port": 8000,
          "path": "/",
          "status": 200,
          "contains": "Shop front"
        },
        {
          "service": "api",
          "port": 8000,
          "path": "/",
          "status": 200,
          "json": {
            "items": 3
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
